# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the tp4/ship-4 window (the combined ship candidate; scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/ship-4 and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN, ONE TAG AT A TIME (wait for the run to finish; never cancel a running card job).
# Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from the branch by its author. ORDER.txt has the
# order, the stop rules, the minutes and the read rules.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-ship-4 is a PLACEHOLDER for the tag B0 builds from the pushed branch head WITH the K64j-OQ graft (sed -i 's/tp4-ship-4/<tag>/' *.env). A commit of a file
# the image carries needs a new B0 build and a new tag in every template. This window never stops, starts or hands back the node agent.
# A1 (EXACTNESS of the whole candidate, STOP): c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-fx-s4-audit = the candidate with EVERY audit on: the combined fusion arm with
# each lever's audit, the prefill SDPA with one q chunk per core and the 13x10 grids with theirs, octo-T8 with the bundle, glue, vglue, packed-window and F1 audits (the
# host read-back audits SAMPLED: QWEN_FAST_AUDIT_FIRST=1, QWEN_FAST_AUDIT_EVERY=16), the tile-aligned drafter window with its audit, the third block's memory plan, and the
# host KV tier with every instrument on (the multi launch's own SDPA audit beside W2). warmup, coding, parked_turns (the 40 agent turns: returning sessions rebind onto
# parked engines), the solo prefill ladder (the prefill levers in every chunk) and concurrent8_steady (the octo rounds). READ: c2_smoke_check clean under every rule at
# once, i.e. python3 scripts/ci/octo_judge.py --container-log <container log> --profile c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-fx-s4-audit clean: one "[OCTO]
# admitted mode=live" line, the UNQUALIFIED lines, at least 16 rounds with shape=octo at 8 live and rows=8 (the positive control: written after the octo block's own verify
# counter moved), no counted m3 round under live, no program compiled on the first octo round, the K64j geometry line (extent replay engaged segments=8 flags=0x21 ... G8B1)
# and the factory line for the bundle's launch size (entries=4 kv_share=false), and the lever rules: the octo draft engaged once and serving at least half of the 8-live
# octo rounds, the bundle engaged ONCE (the latch: the warm and the captured fixture build one bundle) with its call line, the glue8 engaged line for every site at users=8
# rows=8 and 48 layers, no fallback, disabled or fell-back line anywhere. the tier's attach lines in the container log ('host tier IO attached', 'host tier on gib=32.00'
# with verify=sample audit=0 on the candidate and verify=all audit=1 on the audited twin) and no 'latched off' line; the audits: "tp4 vglue audit <n> exact=True ...
# sample=first:1,every:16" lines with entries above 0, "[OCTO-ATTN-BUNDLE] audit <n> exact=True", the T2 window and F1 spread audit lines, the oneq and grid13 audit lines
# (grid13_smoke), the K/V page writer's "octo 8-row served path" line once, the memory ledger: octo_draft_built and the free DRAM after the attach per chip (RECORD the
# figure: the third block, the draft capture AND the 32 GiB host tier beside the engines are the plan's named risks). NO "audit mismatch", no "fell back", no stall. ANY
# failure is NO-GO for the candidate and halts the window. The restore's own audits are TC1's (the smoke forces no eviction). TELEMETRY (C2_TELEMETRY=1,
# scripts/ci/card_telemetry.py): the read-only ARC sidecar samples every chip once a second through the smoke step; read telemetry-smoke/telemetry-summary.txt beside the
# result, and the first [TELEMETRY] line must say decode check ok. A gain that comes with a different loaded AICLK between the arms is the clocks, not the lever. Duration
# (estimate): 110 minutes.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-ship-4
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-fx-s4-audit
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,coding,parked_turns,prefill_ladder_solo,concurrent8_steady
C2_TELEMETRY=1
C2_BOX_MINUTES=150
